      "textSnippet": "CloudBox Enterprise Reference Architecture v3.2\n\n1. Zero-Knowledge Encryption Layer\nAll objects are chunked into 4 MB blocks, encrypted client-side with AES-256-GCM before TLS 1.3 transport.\n\n2. Multi-Region Replication\nMetadata indexes replicate across US-West, EU-Central, and AP-Northeast within 180ms p95.",
